0..55 Comment "/// A run that reaches a definition behind a held path."
56..59 Comment "///"
60..138 Comment "/// Whiskering a reflexivity twice gives a reflexivity, so it is a unit of the"
139..169 Comment "/// composite beside any path."
170..173 Comment "///"
174..253 Comment "/// The inner whiskering is a held call inside the outer one\'s action on paths."
254..335 Comment "/// The composite runs the outer call, and the run goes on through the inner one."
336..339 Comment "///"
340..421 Comment "/// - see: #3774 — the run stopped at the held call and left the endpoint unrun"
